{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華指責以色列人拜偶像"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"「吹響號角警告眾人吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人要如鷹撲向耶和華的家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為百姓背棄我的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"違背我的律法。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要向我呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我們的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們以色列人認識你。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列已經棄絕良善，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以敵人要追趕他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們擁立君王，未經我的同意；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"選立首領，沒有讓我知道。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們用金銀為自己製造偶像，自取滅亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我鄙棄撒瑪利亞人所拜的牛犢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要向他們發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們到什麼時候才能潔身自守呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這牛犢是以色列的工匠造的，並不是上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒瑪利亞的牛犢必被砸得粉碎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們種的是風，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收的是暴風。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的莊稼長不出穗子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"產不出麵粉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是有收成，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也要被外族人吃掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列被吞滅了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在列國之中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像無用的器皿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們投奔亞述，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像孤獨漂泊的野驢。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮收買情人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"儘管他們在各國賄買盟友，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今我要把他們聚集起來審判。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必因君王和首領的欺壓而日漸衰微。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「以法蓮增建許多除罪的祭壇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些祭壇卻成為他的犯罪之處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我為他寫下千萬條的律法，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他卻視若無睹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們獻給我祭牲，並吃祭肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但不蒙耶和華的悅納。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必記住他們的罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追討他們的罪債，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們回到埃及。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列忘記了他的創造主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"建造許多宮殿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大興建許多堅城。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我要降火燒毀他們的城邑和堡壘。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}